sequenceDiagram
    actor "User" as User
    actor "Flutter Mobile Client" as FlutterMobileClient
    participant "Isar Local DB" as IsarLocalDB
    participant "Backend API Host" as BackendAPIHost
    participant "PostgreSQL DB" as PostgreSQLDB

    activate FlutterMobileClient
    User->>FlutterMobileClient: 1. 1. logReadingSession(bookId, pagesRead, duration)
    FlutterMobileClient->>FlutterMobileClient: 2. 2. alt [ isOffline == true ]
    activate IsarLocalDB
    FlutterMobileClient->>IsarLocalDB: 3. 3. writeTxn(new ReadingSession{ syncStatus: 'unsynced', clientTimestamp: NOW_UTC, ... })
    IsarLocalDB-->>FlutterMobileClient: 4. returns new local objectId
    FlutterMobileClient->>FlutterMobileClient: 5. 5. Connectivity listener detects online state and triggers SynchronizationService
    FlutterMobileClient->>IsarLocalDB: 6. 6. queryAll('FROM ReadingSession WHERE syncStatus = "unsynced"')
    IsarLocalDB-->>FlutterMobileClient: 7. returns [unsyncedSession1, unsyncedSession2, ...]
    activate BackendAPIHost
    FlutterMobileClient->>BackendAPIHost: 8. 8. loop [for each unsynced item in batch] POST /api/v1/sessions/sync
    BackendAPIHost-->>FlutterMobileClient: 13. 200 OK (with updated server model)
    activate PostgreSQLDB
    BackendAPIHost->>PostgreSQLDB: 9. 9. FindAsync(id) or FirstOrDefaultAsync(u => u.Id == ...)
    PostgreSQLDB-->>BackendAPIHost: 10. returns existing record (or null)
    BackendAPIHost->>BackendAPIHost: 11. 11. alt [ dto.clientTimestamp > serverRecord.updatedAt ]
    BackendAPIHost->>PostgreSQLDB: 12. 12. UPDATE "ReadingSessions" SET ...; SaveChangesAsync()
    PostgreSQLDB-->>BackendAPIHost: returns success
    FlutterMobileClient->>IsarLocalDB: 14. 14. writeTxn(update session.id, { syncStatus: 'synced' })
    IsarLocalDB-->>FlutterMobileClient: 15. returns success
    FlutterMobileClient->>BackendAPIHost: 16. 16. GET /api/v1/data/pull?since=lastSyncTimestamp
    BackendAPIHost-->>FlutterMobileClient: 17. 200 OK (with delta of new/updated server data)
    FlutterMobileClient->>IsarLocalDB: 18. 18. writeTxn(upsert received server data)
    IsarLocalDB-->>FlutterMobileClient: 19. returns success

    note over FlutterMobileClient: Phase 1: Offline Data Creation. All user-generated data is written to the local Isar DB with a st...
    note over FlutterMobileClient: Phase 2: Online Synchronization. Triggered by network restoration. This is a two-step process: 1....
    note over BackendAPIHost: Conflict Resolution: 'Last Write Wins'. The server compares the clientTimestamp from the incoming...

    deactivate PostgreSQLDB
    deactivate BackendAPIHost
    deactivate IsarLocalDB
    deactivate FlutterMobileClient
